  title="Fahrenheit to Celsius Converter — °F to °C | ComputeZap"
  description="Convert Fahrenheit to Celsius instantly. °C = (°F − 32) ÷ 1.8. Free temperature converter with cooking charts, oven temperatures, and meat doneness guide."
  canonical="/fahrenheit-to-celsius"
  schema={schema}
