    <h2>Fahrenheit to Celsius Formula</h2>
    <p>To convert <strong>Fahrenheit to Celsius</strong>, subtract 32 from the Fahrenheit value then divide by 1.8. To go the other way, multiply °C by 1.8 and add 32.</p>
